ollowing numerical method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δy & =(xy+{y}^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\ {y}_{\\text{new}} & =y+Δy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf the exact solution is ${y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)=3{x}^{2}+5x,$ find an expression for the local truncation error for the step from $x$ to ${x}_{\\text{new}}=x+Δx.$" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323892 1113 #uuid "8ade79ae-1aca-58de-966f-f85c3ca37b03" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323892 1145 "The local truncation error (LTE) is the error made in a single step of a numerical method, when the step begins from an exact value. The LTE of a numerical method at step $n$ from $x$ with exact value ${y}_{\\text{exact}}$ to ${x}_{\\text{new}}=x+Δx$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{τ}_{n} & ={y}_{\\text{exact}}({x}_{\\text{new}})-{y}_{\\text{new}} \\\\  & ={y}_{\\text{exact}}({x}_{\\text{new}})-({y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)+Δy).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're given that the exact solution of the initial value problem is ${y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)=3{x}^{2}+5x.$ Now, let's find the $y$-increment given by the numerical method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δy & =(x\\cdot {y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)+{y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =(x\\cdot (3{x}^{2}+5x)+(3{x}^{2}+5x)^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =(3{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+9{x}^{4}+30{x}^{3}+25{x}^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =(9{x}^{4}+33{x}^{3}+30{x}^{2})\\cdot Δx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the exact value at ${x}_{\\text{new}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{\\text{exact}}({x}_{\\text{new}}) & =({y}_{\\text{exact}}(x)+Δx) \\\\  & =3(x+Δx)^{2}+5(x+Δx) \\\\  & =3({x}^{2}+2x\\cdot Δx+(Δx)^{2})+5x+5(Δx) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}+6x\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}+5x+5(Δx) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}+5x+(6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the LTE for step $n$ starting at $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{τ}_{n} & ={y}_{\\text{exact}}({x}_{\\text{new}})-{y}_{\\text{new}} \\\\  & =[3{x}^{2}+5x+(6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}]-[3{x}^{2}+5x+(9{x}^{4}+33{x}^{3}+30{x}^{2})\\cdot Δx] \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-3{x}^{2}+5x-5x+(6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}-(9{x}^{4}+33{x}^{3}+30{x}^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =(6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}-(9{x}^{4}+33{x}^{3}+30{x}^{2})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =(-9{x}^{4}-33{x}^{3}-30{x}^{2}+6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323894 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323895 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323896 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323897 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323898 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1041 "selection" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1104 #edb/ref 17592186323898 13194139534973 true] [17592186323893 1110 #uuid "32e30fb8-5731-5c7d-ba8f-da73f0bcefee" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323894 1034 "(2x-{x}^{3})\\cdot Δx+2(Δx)^{2}" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323894 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534973 true] [17592186323894 1111 #uuid "6e0b9d37-ca6e-5d3a-bdcf-edb03888c2c4" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323895 1034 "9{x}^{4}+33{x}^{3}+30{x}^{2}+6x+5\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323895 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534973 true] [17592186323895 1111 #uuid "7ec0539a-7f25-5903-9c89-0d3371a2660d" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323896 1034 "(x-{x}^{3}-{x}^{4})\\cdot Δx+(Δx)^{2}" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323896 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534973 true] [17592186323896 1111 #uuid "9d60b68a-5d31-5510-9828-66495b91d95a" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323897 1034 "(2x-2{x}^{3}-{x}^{4})\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323897 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534973 true] [17592186323897 1111 #uuid "2d3f85b2-a75c-56ab-846f-f126d6660a29" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323898 1034 "(-9{x}^{4}-33{x}^{3}-30{x}^{2}+6x+5)\\cdot Δx+3(Δx)^{2}" 13194139534973 true] [17592186323898 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534973 true] [17592186323898 1111 #uuid "33cabdf6-a90b-5bac-a2ad-530597039bc9" 